{
  "description": "Conformance cases for the two v2 readers: direction command is the helper reading the owner's lines (ParseVoiceControlCommandV2), direction event is the owner reading the helper's (ParseVoiceControlEventV2). The forms and results are those of voice-control/cases.json; a hello never comes out of the v2 event reader (the hello is v1, read before the version is chosen), so there is no offers field. The framing rules are v1's and are not repeated case by case here beyond one of each code; what these cases pin is what v2 adds: set_devices and set_talk_mode, the state's talk_mode and playback, the changed consistency rules, and that neither reader takes a line of the other version.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "start",
      "direction": "command",
      "line": "{\"schema\":\"conch.voice_control.v2\",\"kind\":\"start\",\"id\":1,\"server\":\"https://conch.example.org\",\"channel\":\"general\",\"principal_id\":7,\"credential\":\"stored\",\"muted\":false,\"deafened\":false}",
      "want": {
        "result": "accept",
        "kind": "start"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "start with a talk_mode field: the mode is not carried in start, and the field is ignored",
      "direction": "command",
      "line": "{\"schema\":\"conch.voice_control.v2\",\"kind\":\"start\",\"id\":1,\"server\":\"https://conch.example.org\",\"channel\":\"general\",\"principal_id\":7,\"credential\":\"stored\",\"muted\":false,\"deafened\":false,\"talk_mode\":\"open\"}",
      "want": {
        "result": "accept",
        "kind": "start"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "start with a field it does not declare, named token: ignored, and never repeated",
      "direction": "command",
      "line": "{\"schema\":\"conch.voice_control.v2\",\"kind\":\"start\",\"id\":1,\"server\":\"https://conch.example.org\",\"channel\":\"general\",\"principal_id\":7,\"credential\":\"stored\",\"muted\":false,\"deafened\":false,\"token\":\"conch_FAKE_login_token_do_not_print\"}",
      "want": {
        "result": "accept",
        "kind": "start"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "set_mute",
      "direction": "command",
      "line": "{\"schema\":\"conch.voice_control.v2\",\"kind\":\"set_mute\",\"id\":7,\"muted\":true}",
      "want": {
        "result": "accept",
        "kind": "set_mute"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "set_deafen",
      "direction": "command",
      "line": "{\"schema\":\"conch.voice_control.v2\",\"kind\":\"set_deafen\",\"id\":7,\"deafened\":false}",
      "want": {
        "result": "accept",
        "kind": "set_deafen"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "get_state",
      "direction": "command",
      "line": "{\"schema\":\"conch.voice_control.v2\",\"kind\":\"get_state\",\"id\":7}",
      "want": {
        "result": "accept",
        "kind": "get_state"
      }
    },
